type look
version 1
---
# Coin Duel's look (og-taste §12), named by GameDesc.look in src/main.ts:
# the catalogue's neon UI style for the scores and the status line (an
# arcade duel on a dark floor, in a style of its own rather than the
# engine's default). The floor, the fighters and the coin are the sprites
# start places in their own inks.
name "Coin Duel"
ui "cyber"
